option.SHADOW_STRENGTH.comment=Controls cast-shadow darkness independently of ambient fill.
option.AMBIENT_LIGHT.comment=Raises light in shaded outdoor areas. Cave and torch brightness still follows Minecraft's lightmap.
option.NIGHT_AMBIENT=§aNight ambient fill§r
option.NIGHT_AMBIENT.comment=Controls nighttime outdoor fill separately from daytime ambient. Does not add cave lights.
option.MOON_CONTRAST=§aMoonlight contrast§r
option.MOON_CONTRAST.comment=Lower values soften directional moonlight shading while retaining the vanilla night lightmap.
option.VISUAL_STYLE=Visual style
value.VISUAL_STYLE.0=Vanilla
value.VISUAL_STYLE.1=§cDARK FANTASY§r
option.DARK_STYLE_STRENGTH=§aDark Fantasy strength§r
option.DARK_STYLE_STRENGTH.comment=Grim palette: muted daylight, cold blue shadows, subdued skies and rusty sunsets. Lower strength for a gentler treatment.
option.DARK_HAZE=§aDark Fantasy distance haze§r
option.DARK_HAZE.comment=Outdoor distance haze, reduced in caves and strengthened during rain. Not volumetric fog.
option.DARK_LIGHT_TINT=§aDark Fantasy light color§r
option.DARK_LIGHT_TINT.comment=Original lighting only: separates cool shade, warm sunlight and block light. Independent lighting uses its own palette. Sky, fog and grading are controlled separately.

screen.DIAGNOSTICS=Diagnostics
profile.comment=Air is the former Pro. Pro reproduces the saved Custom configuration with FXAA off. Pro Max is the former Pro Max Plus, with FXAA off. Changing a tracked setting shows Custom; art style remains independent. Impact colors: §aGreen = Low§r, §eYellow = Medium§r, §cRed = High§r. Costs depend on the selected mode and scene.
option.VISUAL_STYLE.comment=Choose Vanilla, Dark Fantasy or Miyazaki independently of performance.

value.VISUAL_STYLE.2=§bMIYAZAKI§r
option.CARTOON_STRENGTH=§aMiyazaki strength§r
option.CARTOON_STRENGTH.comment=Storybook palette: turquoise sky, ivory daylight, cool teal shade, pale gold sunset and blue nights. Preserves texture detail. Only affects Miyazaki.

value.SHADOW_FILTER.2=§cHigh impact: soft (9 samples)§r
option.SHADOW_FILTER.comment=Air uses one shadow sample, saved Pro four, and Pro Max nine. Shadow resolution and distance are controlled separately.

