value.MAX_AO.0=Off
value.MAX_AO.1=On
value.MAX_SUNBEAMS.0=Off
value.MAX_SUNBEAMS.1=On
option.MAX_AO.comment=MEDIUM impact. Contact shading is disabled in Air and Pro, enabled in Pro Max.
option.MAX_SUNBEAMS.comment=HIGH impact outdoors. Sunbeams are disabled in Air, enabled in Pro and Pro Max.

option.MAX_LIGHTING=§eIndependent lighting§r
value.MAX_LIGHTING.0=Original
value.MAX_LIGHTING.1=Sun / sky / block light
option.MAX_LIGHTING.comment=LOW to MEDIUM impact. Separates sky, sun and local lighting with highlight compression. Air uses the simpler path; Pro and Pro Max enable independent lighting.

