option.APPLE_SUN_SETUP=§aSunbeam optimization§r
option.APPLE_SUN_SETUP.comment=Recommended On. Reduces repeated work when sunbeams are active while keeping their quality.
value.APPLE_SUN_SETUP.0=Off
value.APPLE_SUN_SETUP.1=On
option.APPLE_DEPTH_RECONSTRUCTION=§aDepth optimization§r
option.APPLE_DEPTH_RECONSTRUCTION.comment=Recommended On. Reduces depth reconstruction work for effects such as AO while retaining the general-projection fallback.
value.APPLE_DEPTH_RECONSTRUCTION.0=Off
value.APPLE_DEPTH_RECONSTRUCTION.1=On

screen.CLOUD_SETTINGS=§cClouds§r
option.CLOUD_STYLE=§cCloud style§r
value.CLOUD_STYLE.0=Vanilla
value.CLOUD_STYLE.1=SDV Skybox
value.CLOUD_STYLE.2=Fading Clouds
option.CLOUD_STYLE.comment=SDV Skybox uses the adapted reference renderer and cloud map with macOS Shaders preset tones and terrain-independent reach. Fading Clouds and Vanilla remain available.
option.CLOUD_OPACITY=§aCustom cloud opacity§r
option.CLOUD_OPACITY.comment=Opacity of custom clouds. Does not affect Vanilla clouds.

screen.CELESTIAL_SETTINGS=§aSun and Moon§r
option.CUBIC_CELESTIALS=§aSun and moon style§r
value.CUBIC_CELESTIALS.0=Game / Resource Pack
value.CUBIC_CELESTIALS.1=Cubic
option.CUBIC_CELESTIALS.comment=LOW impact. Uses custom sun/moon sprites and eight moon phases. Available in all three tiers.

screen.WATER_SETTINGS=§cWater§r
option.MAKEUP_WATER=§cWater style§r
value.MAKEUP_WATER.0=Game / Resource Pack
value.MAKEUP_WATER.1=MakeUp Adaptation
option.MAKEUP_WATER.comment=MEDIUM to HIGH combined cost. Custom waves and depth-based water add sampling and a scene snapshot. Reflections are the largest optional addition.

option.WATER_WAVE_STRENGTH=§aWater wave strength§r
option.WATER_WAVE_STRENGTH.comment=Controls procedural wave normals, without moving the water geometry.
option.WATER_REFLECTIONS=§cWater reflections§r
option.WATER_REFLECTIONS.comment=Sky + includes terrain and object reflections. HIGH impact around water. Sky + traces terrain reflections; Sky avoids that trace. Off disables reflections.

screen.WET_GROUND_SETTINGS=§cPuddles and Wet Ground§r
option.RAIN_PUDDLES=§eRain puddles§r
value.RAIN_PUDDLES.0=Off
value.RAIN_PUDDLES.1=On
option.RAIN_PUDDLES.comment=LOW to MEDIUM impact on rainy ground without reflections. Adds puddle coverage and wet darkening. Sky + wet reflections add a separate high cost.
option.WET_GROUND_REFLECTIONS=§cWet ground reflections§r
value.WET_GROUND_REFLECTIONS.0=Off
value.WET_GROUND_REFLECTIONS.1=§aSky (Light): low impact§r
value.WET_GROUND_REFLECTIONS.2=§cSky +: high impact§r
option.WET_GROUND_REFLECTIONS.comment=Sky + includes terrain and object reflections. Sky (Light) uses flat puddle normals, skips faint reflections and fades them earlier with distance. Sky + retains animated normals and terrain tracing. Off keeps wet darkening. Cost still depends on wet screen coverage.

screen.WEATHER_SETTINGS=§aWeather§r
option.UNOBTRUSIVE_WEATHER=§aUnobtrusive weather§r
option.UNOBTRUSIVE_WEATHER.comment=LOW impact. Replaces rain and snow texture sampling; does not add particle simulation. Available in all three tiers.
option.RAIN_RIPPLES=§eRain ripples§r
option.RAIN_RIPPLES.comment=LOW to MEDIUM impact on rainy water. Requires custom water with refraction or reflections. Off removes the rain-ring calculations.
option.RAIN_RIPPLE_STRENGTH=§aRain ripple strength§r


option.WATER_REFRACTION=§eWater refraction§r
option.WATER_ABSORPTION=§aWater absorption§r
option.WATER_ABSORPTION.comment=Higher values make deep water more opaque.
value.WATER_REFLECTIONS.0=Off
value.WATER_REFLECTIONS.1=§aSky (low impact)§r
value.WATER_REFLECTIONS.2=§cSky + (high impact)§r

option.SDV_CLOUD_STEPS=§cSkybox cloud depth quality§r
option.SDV_CLOUD_STEPS.comment=MEDIUM to HIGH impact when much of the sky is visible. More steps improve cloud thickness. One layer costs less than two.

option.FOLIAGE_WIND=§aFoliage wind§r
option.FOLIAGE_WIND.comment=LOW impact. Vertex-only sway with matching shadows, fading out by 48 blocks. No extra wind textures or screen effects. Off removes animation work.
option.FOLIAGE_WIND_STRENGTH=§aWind strength§r

option.SHADOWS=§cShadows§r
option.SHADOWS.comment=Off skips the shadow pass and receiving comparisons. Sunbeams also require shadows.
option.MAX_AO_QUALITY=§eAO quality§r
value.MAX_AO_QUALITY.1=§eMedium impact: 4 samples§r
value.MAX_AO_QUALITY.2=§cHigh impact: 8 samples§r
option.SUNBEAM_STEPS=§cSunbeam quality§r
option.SDV_CLOUD_LAYERS=§cCloud layers§r
option.WATER_SSR_STEPS=§cWater scene reflection quality§r
option.WATER_SSR_STEPS.comment=HIGH impact only with Sky + water reflections. More samples improve scene tracing but cost more per water pixel.

option.shadowMapResolution.comment=HIGH impact while shadows are enabled. Higher resolution makes finer shadows but uses more graphics memory and shadow rendering work.

option.shadowDistance.comment=HIGH impact while shadows are enabled. Longer range draws more terrain and foliage into the shadow map.

option.SDV_CLOUD_LAYERS.comment=MEDIUM to HIGH impact in open skies. Two layers run cloud sampling twice. Air uses one layer; Pro and Pro Max use two.

option.WATER_REFRACTION.comment=MEDIUM impact over water. Distorts the scene beneath water and uses the scene snapshot. Turn off for simpler water.

option.MAX_AO_QUALITY.comment=MEDIUM impact while AO is on. Eight samples shade more directions than four at greater cost.

option.SUNBEAM_STEPS.comment=HIGH impact while sunbeams are on. More samples smooth the rays but increase sampling work.

screen.PERF_SHADOWS=§cShadows (High impact)§r
screen.PERF_CLOUDS=§cClouds (Medium-High)§r
screen.PERF_WATER=§cWater (High impact)§r
screen.PERF_EFFECTS=§cLighting effects (High)§r
screen.PERF_FOLIAGE=§aFoliage (Low impact)§r

screen.PERF_ANTIALIASING=§eEdge smoothing (Medium)§r
screen.COLOR_GRADING=§aColor grading§r
option.ENTITY_SHADOWS=§cMob/entity shadows§r
option.ENTITY_SHADOWS.comment=Shadows from mobs and other entities. Your own player shadow has a separate toggle. Requires Shadows.
option.BLOCK_ENTITY_SHADOWS=§cBlock entity shadows§r
option.BLOCK_ENTITY_SHADOWS.comment=Shadows from rendered block entities such as chests. Disabling can reduce shadow rendering work. Requires Shadows.
option.FXAA=§eFast edge smoothing§r
option.FXAA.comment=MEDIUM impact: spatial smoothing without history buffers. Reduces jagged edges but can soften texture detail. Does not eliminate temporal foliage shimmer.
option.GRADE_BRIGHTNESS=§aBrightness§r
option.GRADE_CONTRAST=§aContrast§r
option.GRADE_SATURATION=§aSaturation§r
option.GRADE_GREEN_SATURATION=§aGreen saturation§r
option.GRADE_GREEN_SATURATION.comment=Adjusts green-dominant colors in the final image, including green sky or objects. Does not identify materials.

