option.WET_REFLECTION_RESOLUTION.comment=Half traces/shades wet reflections at half width and height (one quarter of pixels), then uses full-resolution wet coverage and depth-aware upscaling. Full retains native detail. Water reflection resolution is unchanged. Savings depend on scene and upscaling overhead.

option.PLAYER_SHADOW=§aPlayer shadow§r
value.PLAYER_SHADOW.0=Off
value.PLAYER_SHADOW.1=On
option.PLAYER_SHADOW.comment=Keep your own player shadow independently of mob/entity shadows. Requires Shadows. For player-only entity shadows, turn this On and Mob/entity shadows and Block entity shadows Off. Terrain shadows remain enabled.
