screen.BLOOM_SETTINGS=§eBloom§r
option.BLOOM=§eBloom§r
option.BLOOM.comment=MEDIUM impact. Soft glow around bright light sources such as torches, candles, lava, portals and the sun. Adds one full-screen pass. Off in Air, on in Pro and Pro Max.
value.BLOOM.0=Off
value.BLOOM.1=On
option.BLOOM_STRENGTH=§aBloom strength§r
option.BLOOM_STRENGTH.comment=How bright the glow is. Changing it does not change the cost.
option.BLOOM_THRESHOLD=§aBloom threshold§r
option.BLOOM_THRESHOLD.comment=How bright a pixel must be to glow. Lower values make more of the scene glow, including pale daylit blocks.
